{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e04-scene-06",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "戦の前の腹ごしらえだ  (Fueling Up Before the Battle)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "reika": "麗華",
    "student": "生徒",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the cramped production office, the crew sits down to a homemade lunch and immediately argues over pickled side dishes touching the rice—until Muranishi steps in. Listen to the crew and Muranishi in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "漬け物の皿は別にしてくんない？私、味混ざんの嫌なんだよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ちょっとぐらいじゃ味変わんないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "舌が野蛮なんだよ。私、こういう境界線ははっきりしたいタイプなの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "僕、あんまり食べないんで、どっちでも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "だから男ばっかは嫌なんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そんな言い方すんだったら、自炊当番やってくださいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ちょっとケンカしないでくださいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うっせえな、お前らは。静かに食え。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すっげえ食い合わせだな。腹に入れば同じだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うまいぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "素材を生かすも殺すも、料理人の腕しだいだからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "食え、ほら、戦の前の腹ごしらえだ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "漬け物の皿は別にしてくんない？私、味混ざんの嫌なんだよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you put the pickles on a separate plate? I hate it when the flavors mix together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ちょっとぐらいじゃ味変わんないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just a little bit won't change the flavor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "舌が野蛮なんだよ。私、こういう境界線ははっきりしたいタイプなの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your palate is barbaric! I'm the type who likes clear boundaries on things like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "僕、あんまり食べないんで、どっちでも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't eat very much anyway, so either way is fine by me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "だから男ばっかは嫌なんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is why I hate working in an office full of men!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そんな言い方すんだったら、自炊当番やってくださいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you're going to talk like that, please take a turn on cooking duty yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ちょっとケンカしないでくださいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, please stop arguing while we eat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うっせえな、お前らは。静かに食え。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pipe down, all of you — eat quietly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すっげえ食い合わせだな。腹に入れば同じだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a wild food combination — well, it all goes to the same stomach.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うまいぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This tastes great.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "素材を生かすも殺すも、料理人の腕しだいだからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whether fine ingredients come alive or go to waste depends entirely on the chef's skill.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "食え、ほら、戦の前の腹ごしらえだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Eat up — fuel your stomachs before the battle.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
